msgctxt "model:gnuhealth.protein.disease,description:DI-00212"
msgid ""
"A disorder characterized by ventricular dilation and impaired systolic "
"function, resulting in congestive heart failure and arrhythmia. Patients are"
" at risk of premature death. Cardiomyopathy dilated type 1C is associated "
"with left ventricular non-compaction in some patients. Left ventricular non-"
"compaction is characterized by numerous prominent trabeculations and deep "
"intertrabecular recesses in hypertrophied and hypokinetic segments of the "
"left ventricle."
msgstr ""

