"intellectual disability, short stature, facial stigmata, and recurrent "
"bacterial peripheral infections with persistently elevated peripheral "
"leukocytes. Biochemically, CDG2C is characterized by a lack of fucosylated "
"glycoconjugates, including selectin ligands."
msgstr ""

