msgctxt "model:gnuhealth.protein.disease,description:DI-00870"
msgid ""
"A form of non-syndromic deafness characterized by bilateral progressive "
"hearing loss, which first affects the high frequencies. Hearing loss begins "
"in the second decade, and by age 50 is severe in high and middle frequencies"
" and moderate at low frequencies."
msgstr ""

