"proportion of chronic ophthalmoplegias are associated with other symptoms, "
"leading to a multisystemic pattern of this disease. Additional symptoms are "
"variable, and may include cataracts, hearing loss, sensory axonal "
"neuropathy, ataxia, depression, hypogonadism, and parkinsonism."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "model:gnuhealth.protein.disease,description:DI-00945"
msgid ""
"A disorder characterized by progressive weakness of ocular muscles and "
